<title>INDIA: Delhi shares end down ahead of oil price meeting.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares end down ahead of oil price meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares closed lower on Monday on nervous selling ahead of a meeting of the ruling United Front coalition where an increase in petroleum products prices is due to be discussed.</p>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange sensitive index closed 1.41 points down at 847.64 after rising to 852.20 in early trade.</p>
